    "turn_idx": 95,
    "turn_text": "But, uh, What I did was, I think there were, it makes sense. There were some folks who would like to see me step aside so they have a chance to move on. I get that, that's just human nature. But that wasn't the reason that I stepped down. I stepped down because I started thinking about it. You know, it's hard to think of, I know you're only 30. But it's hard to think of, it's hard for me to even say how old I am.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_14",
