    "turn_text": "It's about 20, 22 minutes long. You can go and check it out. We covered many, many bases. We all said Grover Norquist on earlier in the program. Grover laid out exactly what unrealized gains are because we keep hearing about it. And Kamala Harris and Tim Walz would like to tax your unrealized gains. It's basically if you've got stocks, even in your pension, your 401k, and the value goes up, they want you to pay a tax on the increase in value even before you cash the stocks in or get any of that money back. And if the stock were to go down, of course, they're not going to give you any of the tax money back. They just want to, it's a money grab. That's what Democrats always do. No matter what they say, always look at what it is that they do. You can go to comillonomics.org, comillonomics.org, and it's a website that ATR put up to show you exactly what her stances are on all of this stuff and then some. And as we go through my social media roundup, make sure if you're on TikTok, you stop by at Joe Pags at J-O-E-P-A-G-S. I've got the story of that New Hampshire high school that banned parents that had those wristbands on that said, XX. I've done that in short form. If you want to spread that around, it's my top pinned video there. It's also the first video you'll see when you go to Instagram. which is Joe talk show J-O-E-T-A-L-K-S-H-O-W. Definitely want your thoughts on that. Want you to follow over on social media. We do three hours of the best radio we possibly can. We try our best every day. And then beyond that, I'm doing live streams here and there. We're putting up videos all day and night. Trust me when I say we're trying to make sure we take care of all of your needs. Going into an election that is different than any we've seen in our lifetime. Got to get out of here for now. And again, go to JoePags.com. J-O-E-P-A-G-S dot C-O-M. Always your one-stop shop for everything about the Joe Pags Show. That is Sam. That is Polo. That is Kerry. I'm Joe. Do me a favor. Make sure you stick around tomorrow. Another big show coming your way. We're trying our best to get you as informed as humanly possible as we go forward into this election season. We're working on getting President Trump back. We'll let you know how that's going. JD Vance, we hope to have back again. And I do believe that we'll have somebody from the Trump campaign tomorrow. We'll let you know who that is then. That's it for the Joe Pags Show. Thanks a lot for listening to the podcast. Make sure you stop by JoePags.com and make sure you tune in to every hour we do right here on the Joe Pags Show.",
